{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107812","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107812/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107812/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107812/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107812","id":3165218136,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6bhBwi","number":107812,"title":"Add external editor Exec Flags replacement option for a one-based script line number","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-06-21T16:42:21Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T05:38:34Z","closed_at":"2025-06-21T18:27:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107812","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107812","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107812.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107812.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes #107809 (sort of).\r\n\r\nThis is the least potentially-compatibility-breaking solution I could think of for this problem. VS Code seems to expect the first line of a file to be line 1, whereas Godot expects it to be line 0. As such, when Godot's debugger opens VS Code to focus on a line that threw an error, it places the cursor on the line *before* the error.\r\n\r\n![CleanShot 2025-06-21 at 09 18 37@2x](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9fc5e2a9-8725-4c63-b931-29aed6d03e19)\r\n![CleanShot 2025-06-21 at 09 19 51@2x](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b0ebd3b9-7773-4cbb-9b4d-45da062dd448)\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a new replacement string, `{lineStart1}`, to the potential replacements in the external editor flags. It behaves the same as `{line}`, except that it makes the line numbers start at 1 instead of 0.\r\n\r\nNote that this means it *won't* automatically fix this issue. Users will need to change their Exec Flags to\r\n```\r\n{project} --goto {file}:{lineStart1}:{col}\r\n```\r\nso that it uses the correct replacement. (If this approach is accepted, we will also want to update https://github.com/godotengine/godot-vscode-plugin/blob/master/README.md.)\r\n\r\nAs an alternative to this approach, we could instead update the engine to use one-based line numbers instead of zero-based ones, but I would expect doing so to cause more issues.","closed_by":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107812/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107812/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}